# ============================================================
# Yang TETAP di-upload:
#   README.md, requirements.txt, requirements-app.txt
#   app/                      -> aplikasi Streamlit final (user study A/B)
#   experiments/              -> pipeline final berurutan 01..08
#     01_data_preparation     -> master_dataset.csv + output dataset
#     02_baseline             -> ekstraksi bobot ImageNet (retrieval & rekomendasi)
#     03_lightweight_finetuning   -> training + eval klasifikasi/retrieval/rekomendasi
#     04_partial_unfreeze         -> training + eval (model final: VGG19 Exp3)
#     05_retrieval_analysis       -> analisis retrieval exp3 per kategori
#     06_text_cbf_onehot          -> baseline teks one-hot + analisis leakage
#     07_nn_visualization         -> visualisasi tetangga terdekat per kategori
#     08_user_study               -> data mentah + analisis A/B testing
#   prepare_deploy_data.py    -> bangun arsip data untuk GitHub Releases
#   visualisasi_arsitektur_cnn.ipynb  -> diagram arsitektur CNN (Gambar 2.2-2.5 TA)
#   grafik_peningkatan_recommender.ipynb -> grafik peningkatan performa (Bab 4 TA)
# ============================================================
